  "content": "\n\n# 音乐提示通知\n\n在游戏中播放音乐时，会在屏幕右下角显示提示通知，包含曲目名称、作者及专辑名称。\n\n### **依赖**：[Cloth Config API](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)  \n\n如有任何问题，欢迎在 [GitHub](https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/issues) 提交 Issue。\n\n# 📷 游戏内截图\n<div>\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast_album.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">“显示专辑名称”：true</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/toasts.png\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">不同的提示配置</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/1.21.8/img/modded1.png\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">兼容模组内容（<a href=\"\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-music-discs>More Music Discs</a>）</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n       <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/.github/assets/jukebox_home_tab.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">使用唱片盒菜单随时随地播放任意音乐</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n# 🎀 提示样式\n\n<div>\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">标准提示</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/action_bar.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">操作栏</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"middle\">\n                <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/compact.webp\"/>\n                <figcaption align=\"middle\">紧凑模式</figcaption>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n# ⚙ 设置\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/config.png\">\n\n\n# 视频预览\nhttps://youtu.be/HK2swFtPanA\n\n# 自定义\n如需添加自定义音乐支持或修改现有曲目，请在自定义资源包的 `musicnotification` 命名空间下添加名为 `musics.json` 的文件。\n\nJSON Schema 文档可在此查看：[DOCS.md](https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/blob/next-stonecutter/DOCS.md)\n如有任何疑问，欢迎提交 Issue。\n\n# 贡献者\n唱片图标由 [carotteatomique](https://github.com/carotteatomique) 制作  \n模组图标由 [akairoo](https://dribbble.com/akairoo) 制作  \n简体中文翻译由 [Chiloven945](https://github.com/Chiloven945) 完成",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
